config BR2_PACKAGE_C100_GPU
	bool "c100-gpu"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_VULKAN_TOOLS
	help
	  CPU/GPU clock limits and graphics-channel initialization for the
	  OKdo C100's Tegra210 module. Installs c100-limits, invoked by the
	  board's erlinit configuration before Erlang starts. GPU clocks
	  continue to scale through nouveau's simple_ondemand governor.
